{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_08_end","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_08","title":"抢滩登陆","storyCode":"DH-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"633c07299ebfadfe4f75968ba2888e51dc6815f6d2d3001d8dc15b0dff32a418","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"坎黛拉感谢星熊等人的行动，并邀请她们留下。\n船上，陈和林雨霞一番讨论后，决定了行动方针。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"20_I00"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":true,"text":"咳咳，听得到吗，听得到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":true,"text":"亲爱的市民朋友们，还有游客朋友们，是我，坎黛拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，不用太紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，老潘乔这一出完全在我的预想之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么想得到我信任的手下居然一直密谋着夺取我的城市这么可怕的事呢，这太可怕了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，正如我一开始所说的，这并不是什么值得惊慌的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如说，我要感谢老潘乔才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，这两年，我也一直在思考，怎样才能让大奖赛变得更加刺激，更加引人注目，更加能让人从中获得快乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我一直没有找到特别好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而老潘乔为我找到了，他用自己的行动向我展示了一场更加刺激的大奖赛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大奖赛结束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，恰恰相反。就在刚刚那一刻，本次大奖赛进入了真正的高潮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有队伍在此时都将复活，竞猜环节将会重新启动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽可能地去阻止那些在城里闹事的家伙们，我知道你们有这个本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情结束后，我会给你们应有的奖赏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，就是你们两个吧，我的手下们说，你们在刚才帮他们挡住了一波针对我的刺杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，请坐，作为对你们的褒奖，你们也在这特等座和我一起享受这场比赛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......是认真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然是认真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老潘乔知道，在我面前掀桌子的话，他的赢面很小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他缩在了这艘我交给他保管的船上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我没猜错的话，他应该私底下给这艘船加了不少东西，大炮之类的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果只是这样的话，其实没有那么有威胁吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二轮比赛和第三轮比赛期间，会邀请许多来自各方的权贵上船，让他们能够用自己的双眼体会比赛的乐趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，这些权贵的性命才是关键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这座城市的运转需要和这些人打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，现在就不是我想不想解决他的问题，而是那些老爷的手下们希不希望我立刻解决他的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，阵仗搞得这么大，结果还是来阴的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多半是埃内斯托那小子教他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正如你们所见，现在我能做的事情并不多，但是，实际上他能做的事情也不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，为什么不把事情变得更加有趣一点呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这不是会更加刺激他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要是真的敢把那些老爷拉出来挨个毙了，我就算把这座城市让给他又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不明白，Missy，他既然想要夺取这座城市去打仗，那终究也是要仰仗那些老爷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然他打仗的钱和士兵哪里来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要我说，船上那些老爷里，恐怕早有几个和他已经谈好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你们两个年轻人很有意思啊，看打扮，不是玻利瓦尔人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我们来自龙门，现在还有两个朋友在船上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你们两个竟然是陈世侄和林世侄的朋友？怎么没有听她们提起过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有告诉她们，是偷偷来玩的，您不知道自然也正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我可以多告诉你们一点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将这件事委托给了陈世侄与林世侄，而另一方面，我答应了文月夫人，她们两人在这里不会受到任何危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们知道这意味着什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意味着还不到时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很懂啊，东国的姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果两位世侄真的有什么闪失，那船上的那些老爷们，可就要给可怜的老潘乔陪葬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Missy，别怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来来来，正所谓不打不相识，来，坐，我们好好聊聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解决了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但是情况确实不妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你去对付埃内斯托，我来调查的分工还是太晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不甘心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不甘心......但也没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事没那么简单，早有预感的不是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我没想到会闹这么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"怎么可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你现在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某个船舱里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你和埃内斯托聊天的时候，我到处走了走，虽然在潘乔开始行动前船上气氛还算轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在潘乔演讲之后，船上的那些船员和水手立刻开始行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在船上戒备非常森严，而且武装和补给非常充足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"已经做好了拉锯战的准备了吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，也不是完全没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，他们把船上那些权贵都关到了一间房间里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这是劫匪很常见的做法......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"从人质下手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你也发现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"即使船上有再多的武器和再多的补给，以及陆地上准备了再多的接应，最多我想也只能和掌控着这座城市的坎黛拉女士打成平手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"一旦时间拉长，他胜算并不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这些权贵人质才是他的护身符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，没错，这些权贵全都是来自三方政府的大人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为人质，他们能够起到很好的掣肘作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要很长时间，只需要一小会，只要能让坎黛拉女士在这段时间里有所犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就能做更多的事，也将有更多的筹码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我们只有两个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说白了，我并不是很想玩你那种个人英雄主义的戏码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我来做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"救人交给你，我来帮你分散他们的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以。船上应该有那种救生小船，再不济让他们跳海就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"什么然后？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算救了人就跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你打算一个人留在船上逞英雄的话，我不拦你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。那就这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，开始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":true,"text":"开始吧。对了，电话别挂，保持通信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......这里是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被那个姓陈的打晕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对，我想起来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情正在按照我们计划的进行，已经有几个老爷同意协助爸爸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，陈小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在把你打晕后，好像在船上四处引发混乱，爸爸已经下令捉拿她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"引发混乱......不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉菲艾拉，你现在快带人去关押人质的地方看看情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恐怕陈小姐现在是在为林小姐创造机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让她们劫走人质就糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，哥哥你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，快去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉菲艾拉","speakerId":"avg_421_laplum_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有个老朋友说过，只有被狠狠捶打过一遍，我才会像过去的她一样，知道自己那些可笑的执着都不过是些冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我到现在也还没有分清，哪些是可以坚持的执着，哪些是不切实际的冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我想她应该也是知道的，如果因此我就不去做的话，我也就不叫陈晖洁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊，陈小姐，你知道自己在做什么，也知道该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G06"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃内斯托挣扎着爬了起来，摇摇晃晃地走出了房间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
